mments/2492003073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98446#issuecomment-2492003073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98446","id":2492003073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UiPMB","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-21T18:43:52Z","updated_at":"2024-11-21T18:43:52Z","body":"@JekSun97 Please review and contribute to the discussion here https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/9885 (Needed Skeleton Modifiers)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2492003073/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2493430357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98446#issuecomment-2493430357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98446","id":2493430357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UnrpV","user":{"login":"crei0","id":5162,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0","html_url":"https://github.com/crei0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crei0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T10:29:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T10:43:05Z","body":"I think there's a typo on the Documentation data `doc/classes/LookAtModifier3D.xml`, it's saying in some locations `SkeletonModifier3D` instead of the correct `LookAtModifier3D`\r\n\r\nThis is visible at the documentation page at [https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_lookatmodifier3d.html](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_lookatmodifier3d.html)\r\n\r\nLocation 1:\r\n`The SkeletonModifier3D rotates a bone to look a target.`\r\nit should say\r\n`The LookAtModifier3D rotates a bone to look a target.`\r\n\r\nLocation 2:\r\n`This SkeletonModifier3D rotates a bone to look a target. [...]`\r\nit should say\r\n`This LookAtModifier3D rotates a bone to look a target. [...]`\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd on `Create a new node` window on the tooltip and on the description section\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/705f67a3-85d3-423d-bd51-3f4441de4c69)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPS: I've created an Issue for this at https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99532","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2493430357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]